    "description": "<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:2em; border:2px solid #999; font-size:105%; text-align:center; background:#00008B;\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td><i><b>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> has been <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> per the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Untested\" title=\"Category:Untested\">Untested</a> guidelines. Whether or not it can be used is, as always, the prerogative of the Gamemaster.</b></i></td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p><i>Homebrew Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Legacy_of_the_Force_Sourcebook\" title=\"Legacy of the Force Sourcebook\">Legacy of the Force Sourcebook</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are able to attack when your opponent is most vulnerable- the same instant they strike you.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> 13, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Combat_Reflexes\" title=\"Combat Reflexes\">Combat Reflexes</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dodge\" title=\"Dodge\">Dodge</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per round, when an opponent makes a melee attack against you and misses, you may make an immediate <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Attack of Opportunity</a> against that opponent.</p>",
